# 0218 = 0217 (plan stage 1, EP array + composite descriptors + spin locks):
#   - RUBY_EP_MAX=16, struct ruby_ep array (EP0 + 0x01/0x02/0x81 live wire).
#   - lck_spin_t q_lock per EP (XNU IRQ vs thread queue safety from eint infra).
#   - ruby_build_cfg_desc() assembles cfg from the EP table; wTotalLength
#     and bNumEndpoints are derived, not counted by hand (0216 bug class).
#   - struct ruby_req / ruby_ep_queue / ruby_ep_complete exist as stubs
#     (16KB contiguous guard, 1 req = 1 GPD, SG not yet implemented).
